      <section id="services" class="content-section services-section" aria-labelledby="services-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">What we do</p>
          <h2 id="services-title">Our Services</h2>
        </div>
        <ol class="service-list">
          <li>
            <h3>Systems Analysis</h3>
            <p>
              We analyze business processes, identify problems, and determine
              what kind of system the business needs.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>System Development</h3>
            <p>
              We develop information systems that help businesses manage
              their operations and information.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Business Process Improvement</h3>
            <p>
              We examine existing workflows and find ways to make them more
              efficient through technology.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Database Management</h3>
            <p>
              We design and organize databases so businesses can store, manage,
              and access their information.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>IT &amp; Business Consulting</h3>
            <p>
              We help businesses determine how technology can support their
              goals and solve operational problems.
            </p>
          </li>
        </ol>
        <p><strong>In simple terms:</strong> Analyze &rarr; Develop &rarr; Improve</p>
