      <section id="projects" class="content-section projects-section" aria-labelledby="projects-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">Ideas into systems</p>
          <h2 id="projects-title">Selected Projects</h2>
          <p>
          These are project concepts. Replace them with completed work and
          accurate results as your portfolio develops.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="projects-grid">
          <article class="project-card">
            <div class="project-image project-image-inventory" role="img" aria-label="Inventory system project image placeholder">
              <span>Project image</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Inventory Management System</h3>
            <p><strong>Business problem:</strong> Stock levels and item movement are difficult to track.</p>
            <p><strong>Analysis:</strong> Identify inventory, user, and reporting requirements.</p>
            <p><strong>Proposed system:</strong> A system for recording stock, monitoring levels, and reviewing changes.</p>
            <p><strong>Result:</strong> Add the outcome after the project is developed and evaluated.</p>
            <a class="project-link" href="#contact">View Project <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </article>

          <article class="project-card">
            <div class="project-image project-image-student" role="img" aria-label="Student system project image placeholder">
              <span>Project image</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Student Information System</h3>
            <p><strong>Business problem:</strong> Student records and academic information are spread across manual files.</p>
            <p><strong>Analysis:</strong> Identify the records, roles, and workflows the school needs to manage.</p>
            <p><strong>Proposed system:</strong> A system for organizing student profiles and academic records.</p>
            <p><strong>Result:</strong> Add the outcome after the project is developed and evaluated.</p>
            <a class="project-link" href="#contact">View Project <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </article>

          <article class="project-card">
            <div class="project-image project-image-appointment" role="img" aria-label="Appointment system project image placeholder">
              <span>Project image</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Appointment Management System</h3>
            <p><strong>Business problem:</strong> Scheduling and appointment updates take time to coordinate.</p>
            <p><strong>Analysis:</strong> Map the booking process and identify user and scheduling requirements.</p>
            <p><strong>Proposed system:</strong> A system for organizing appointments and their status.</p>
            <p><strong>Result:</strong> Add the outcome after the project is developed and evaluated.</p>
            <a class="project-link" href="#contact">View Project <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="contact" class="content-section contact-section" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
        <div class="contact-intro">
          <p class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</p>
          <h2 id="contact-title">Let's solve a business problem together.</h2>
          <p>Tell us what your business needs. We’ll start by understanding the problem.</p>
          <p class="contact-placeholder">[Add your preferred email address or other contact details.]</p>
        </div>

        <form class="contact-form" action="#" method="post">
          <div>
            <label for="name">Name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="phone">Mobile Number</label>
            <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" required>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="subject">Subject</label>
            <input id="subject" name="subject" type="text" required>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" required></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit">Send Message</button>
        </form>
      </section>
